WEBVTT

01:31.880 --> 01:32.759
Mr. Ye?

01:34.680 --> 01:35.520
What brings you here?

01:36.240 --> 01:36.920
Was it you

01:37.400 --> 01:38.520
or Fu Hailian?

01:39.039 --> 01:40.680
I have no idea what you're saying.

01:42.800 --> 01:44.240
I think it's Fu Hailian.

01:44.560 --> 01:46.240
He hates the military nobles so much.

01:46.759 --> 01:47.800
He'd love to blow

01:48.039 --> 01:49.039
Great Yan's military nobles

01:49.039 --> 01:49.800
to bits.

01:51.479 --> 01:53.800
Sure, he's thought about it.

01:54.280 --> 01:55.640
But that's all it is.

01:57.479 --> 01:59.080
So I think

01:59.600 --> 02:00.400
it's you.

02:01.280 --> 02:02.520
After all, I've crossed you

02:02.520 --> 02:03.880
more than once.

02:04.520 --> 02:05.320
And you get back at people

02:05.320 --> 02:06.680
over the smallest slight.

02:07.280 --> 02:08.160
You mean

02:08.440 --> 02:09.280
His Majesty removing you

02:09.560 --> 02:10.720
as the Crown Prince's study companion?

02:12.040 --> 02:13.280
So it really was you.

02:13.880 --> 02:14.360
Yes.

02:14.800 --> 02:16.120
It was my duty.

02:16.400 --> 02:17.040
I just made

02:17.040 --> 02:18.360
a suggestion to His Majesty.

02:19.240 --> 02:20.480
It wasn't revenge.

02:20.840 --> 02:22.200
How dare you still deny it?

02:22.800 --> 02:23.720
You call me

02:23.720 --> 02:25.480
someone who holds a grudge.

02:25.800 --> 02:27.960
Taking away a Crown Prince's study companion

02:28.200 --> 02:29.280
is nothing.

02:31.920 --> 02:33.200
Then why did you do it?

02:38.600 --> 02:39.760
Because His Highness

02:40.120 --> 02:41.680
may have loyal men

02:41.960 --> 02:43.440
or sycophants,

02:44.280 --> 02:45.840
but never

02:46.560 --> 02:48.200
someone like you.

02:49.400 --> 02:50.480
What kind of person am I?

02:50.960 --> 02:52.160
A

02:53.520 --> 02:54.880
desperate one.

03:13.840 --> 03:14.440
Sir.

03:17.240 --> 03:19.120
A desperate one, huh.

03:24.480 --> 03:25.240
Do you know

03:26.440 --> 03:28.160
why Chen Yanyun said that?

03:28.440 --> 03:29.440
I don't.

03:30.040 --> 03:30.960
But I know

03:31.000 --> 03:32.079
he's up to no good.

03:34.000 --> 03:34.960
Because he's scared.

03:36.000 --> 03:36.920
He's scared

03:37.520 --> 03:38.560
I'll win the Crown Prince over.

03:41.600 --> 03:42.840
That actually reminds me.

03:43.400 --> 03:44.160
I may not be

03:44.160 --> 03:45.120
the Crown Prince's study companion.

03:45.800 --> 03:46.720
But I'm not letting

03:46.720 --> 03:48.160
the time I spent on him

03:49.360 --> 03:50.640
go to waste.

03:56.560 --> 03:57.000
Sir,

03:57.280 --> 03:58.320
if I may.

03:59.440 --> 04:00.800
His Majesty just ordered a probe

04:00.800 --> 04:01.920
into the attack on the Crown Prince,

04:02.360 --> 04:03.880
and you removed Mr. Ye from his post.

04:04.120 --> 04:04.560
Isn't that

04:05.520 --> 04:06.600
a bit obvious?

04:07.360 --> 04:08.440
Doesn't matter.

04:08.960 --> 04:10.360
Since the late Prince Chengqing's rebellion,

04:10.680 --> 04:12.160
His Majesty has been wary of military nobles.

04:12.600 --> 04:14.200
Now the attack on the Crown Prince

04:14.480 --> 04:15.440
has dragged in the late Prince Chengqing

04:15.440 --> 04:16.800
and Prince Glorian.

04:17.279 --> 04:17.880
I expect

04:18.200 --> 04:18.880
His Majesty will start

04:18.880 --> 04:20.640
cracking down on military nobles soon.

04:21.399 --> 04:22.640
So removing Ye Xian from his post

04:23.120 --> 04:24.120
is nothing but good

04:24.120 --> 04:24.960
for him.

04:25.480 --> 04:26.200
You're trying to

04:26.840 --> 04:27.920
protect Lord Changxing?

04:30.000 --> 04:30.840
Civil officials

04:31.520 --> 04:33.480
and military nobles may be at odds,

04:34.000 --> 04:35.080
but the country

04:36.920 --> 04:38.520
always needs its warriors.

04:39.480 --> 04:41.000
Lord Changxing made real contributions

04:41.080 --> 04:42.280
and can actually fight.

04:44.040 --> 04:45.480
I'll protect him whenever I can.

04:47.120 --> 04:47.560
Understood.

04:52.320 --> 04:54.640
Mr. Ye's always thinking of you.

04:54.880 --> 04:56.800
He knew you were bored in the palace,

04:57.000 --> 04:58.480
so he went out of his way to find

04:58.480 --> 04:59.760
all these fun little things for you.

05:01.480 --> 05:02.600
Too bad he can't

05:02.600 --> 05:03.800
come play with me in the palace anymore.

05:04.040 --> 05:05.240
He has a heart condition.

05:05.760 --> 05:06.440
I can't

05:06.440 --> 05:07.680
force him to stay.

05:08.040 --> 05:09.880
There'll be other chances.

05:25.120 --> 05:26.240
Hold onto this for me.

05:26.440 --> 05:28.240
Show it to me secretly tonight.

05:28.320 --> 05:28.840
Yes.

05:30.400 --> 05:31.840
Ye Xian really gets me.

05:32.680 --> 05:34.560
All my other study companions

05:34.680 --> 05:35.880
treat me like their master now.

05:36.040 --> 05:36.840
So boring.

05:37.520 --> 05:38.960
Ye Xian is the only one

05:42.280 --> 05:43.280
who treats me like a friend!

05:53.640 --> 05:54.880
Ye Xian does so much for me.

05:55.800 --> 05:58.240
I feel bad taking his gifts for nothing.

05:58.880 --> 06:01.280
I should give him something in return.

06:05.320 --> 06:06.120
Mr. Ye,

06:06.720 --> 06:07.960
His Highness specially

06:08.000 --> 06:09.640
grants you this token.

06:11.040 --> 06:11.720
With it,

06:11.880 --> 06:14.120
you may enter and leave the East Palace

06:14.280 --> 06:16.040
anytime without permission.

06:24.080 --> 06:25.280
I'm deeply moved

06:25.560 --> 06:26.440
by His Highness's kindness.

06:26.920 --> 06:28.240
I only hope to recover soon

06:28.560 --> 06:29.920
and continue to serve him.

06:40.800 --> 06:41.680
Uncle.

06:43.040 --> 06:43.800
What brings you here?

06:44.040 --> 06:44.960
What do you need?

06:45.800 --> 06:47.240
A classmate just sent word.

06:47.640 --> 06:48.400
The court has appointed

06:49.000 --> 06:50.159
Mr. Chang Tinglan as chief examiner

06:50.360 --> 06:51.640
for this year's metropolitan exam.

06:52.440 --> 06:53.840
You foresaw this

06:54.080 --> 06:55.640
and told me to seek Mr. Chang's guidance?

06:56.320 --> 06:57.440
Guidance is one thing.

06:57.800 --> 06:58.800
How much you actually learn

06:59.120 --> 07:00.800
depends on your own ability.

07:02.600 --> 07:03.560
Thank you, Uncle.

07:05.440 --> 07:06.040
Go on.

07:13.120 --> 07:13.800
I

07:14.560 --> 07:16.120
have one more thing to ask.

07:17.720 --> 07:18.880
Could you

07:19.200 --> 07:19.600
not

07:19.600 --> 07:20.920
arrange a match for me just yet?

07:21.560 --> 07:23.000
Wait until after the metropolitan exam.

07:23.360 --> 07:23.880
Why?

07:24.240 --> 07:25.280
You have

07:25.920 --> 07:27.160
someone else in mind?

07:34.520 --> 07:35.120
No.

07:35.720 --> 07:36.360
It's just...

07:37.080 --> 07:38.440
I don't want to rush things.

07:44.120 --> 07:45.680
You don't need to go to the academy today.

07:46.840 --> 07:48.000
Come with me somewhere.

07:50.800 --> 07:51.360
Yes.

08:15.840 --> 08:16.480
I know

08:17.320 --> 08:18.920
I shouldn't go against my uncle.

08:20.480 --> 08:21.880
He must have thought long and hard

08:22.600 --> 08:24.360
before arranging a match with the Yu family.

08:24.840 --> 08:25.360
Xuanqing.

08:26.040 --> 08:26.880
But I've followed

08:26.880 --> 08:28.280
his lead my whole life.

08:29.960 --> 08:31.200
This once, even if I'm wrong,

08:33.760 --> 08:35.120
even if it costs me,

08:35.760 --> 08:37.080
I have to take the chance.

08:38.640 --> 08:39.240
Or

08:40.720 --> 08:42.240
I'll regret it for the rest of my life.

08:42.679 --> 08:43.440
Exactly.

08:43.640 --> 08:44.560
I support you.

08:45.520 --> 08:47.640
This is a lifetime decision.

09:15.040 --> 09:15.480
This...

09:16.160 --> 09:16.880
This is the cenotaph

09:17.480 --> 09:19.640
of your birth father, Lin Zhengwei.

09:21.440 --> 09:22.520
Are you wondering

09:22.760 --> 09:24.080
why it's a cenotaph?

09:24.840 --> 09:25.680
Because

09:26.120 --> 09:27.280
your father committed

09:27.280 --> 09:28.600
an unpardonable crime.

09:29.120 --> 09:30.800
He was sentenced to immediate execution.

09:31.720 --> 09:32.440
Back then,

09:32.920 --> 09:33.960
I was too low in rank

09:34.440 --> 09:35.760
to retrieve his body.

09:38.320 --> 09:38.720
But...

09:39.480 --> 09:39.840
But...

09:41.360 --> 09:42.880
But didn't you tell me my father...

09:43.600 --> 09:44.240
my birth father

09:44.960 --> 09:46.560
died protecting you

09:46.960 --> 09:48.480
from river pirates?

09:50.240 --> 09:51.240
That was a lie.

09:52.000 --> 09:52.960
The truth is,

09:53.360 --> 09:54.760
Lin Zhengwei

09:55.080 --> 09:56.080
colluded with the river pirates

09:56.440 --> 09:58.080
and tipped them off about the ship's route.

09:58.400 --> 09:59.720
The ship went down, and people died.

10:00.080 --> 10:01.920
Over a hundred soldiers and officers

10:01.920 --> 10:03.040
drowned.

10:08.880 --> 10:10.920
Now, only two people

10:12.080 --> 10:12.920
know about this.

10:13.920 --> 10:14.600
One is me.

10:15.240 --> 10:16.040
The other is Yu Kaiji,

10:16.320 --> 10:17.960
the former chief of the Jiaodong section

10:18.040 --> 10:20.000
of the canal transport office.

10:20.560 --> 10:22.120
Your future father-in-law.

10:25.440 --> 10:26.040
Then

10:27.200 --> 10:28.480
why did you still take me in?

10:29.720 --> 10:30.720
Because your birth father

10:30.760 --> 10:32.160
did save my life.

10:32.600 --> 10:33.600
And your mother

10:34.080 --> 10:35.640
hanged herself the night your father

10:36.120 --> 10:37.120
was executed.

10:38.280 --> 10:38.960
You were the only one

10:38.960 --> 10:40.240
left in the family.

10:42.120 --> 10:43.280
I didn't realize your mother

10:43.280 --> 10:44.560
hid it from you so well.

10:44.920 --> 10:46.400
You really had no idea.

10:47.600 --> 10:49.080
But you have great literary flair.

10:49.320 --> 10:50.920
Completely different from your father.

10:51.760 --> 10:52.680
I felt sorry for you,

10:53.240 --> 10:54.400
so I brought you home

10:54.400 --> 10:55.760
and adopted you into the Fifth Branch.

10:59.040 --> 10:59.840
I see.

11:01.120 --> 11:02.560
You want me to marry Miss Yu

11:03.680 --> 11:04.960
because her father

11:06.040 --> 11:07.560
will help keep this secret.

11:08.320 --> 11:08.880
Yes.

11:10.320 --> 11:11.240
I expect

11:11.240 --> 11:12.520
you'll pass the metropolitan exam.

11:13.200 --> 11:14.200
But once you do,

11:14.200 --> 11:15.360
you'll draw attention.

11:15.840 --> 11:17.040
Especially from those

11:17.040 --> 11:18.720
who seek a marriage alliance with us.

11:19.520 --> 11:21.120
They'll dig into your background.

11:21.560 --> 11:22.440
And then

11:23.160 --> 11:24.160
this past

11:24.520 --> 11:25.720
will be hard to hide.

11:26.640 --> 11:28.240
Luckily, Kaiji thinks highly of you.

11:28.480 --> 11:29.720
And his daughter, Wanxue,

11:30.240 --> 11:31.560
has feelings for you.

11:32.880 --> 11:34.040
So we agreed

11:34.040 --> 11:34.960
to arrange the match

11:35.160 --> 11:36.160
before the metropolitan exam.

11:37.680 --> 11:38.360
Now you know

11:38.360 --> 11:39.680
everything.

11:39.960 --> 11:41.280
Marry Miss Yu

11:41.680 --> 11:42.320
and keep this secret

11:42.320 --> 11:43.400
as best you can?

11:43.920 --> 11:45.240
Or call off the match

11:45.840 --> 11:47.120
and face whatever comes

11:47.400 --> 11:48.640
after you pass the exam?

11:50.200 --> 11:51.320
You decide.

12:12.000 --> 12:12.600
Miss,

12:13.000 --> 12:14.960
a kite bears your feelings.

12:15.200 --> 12:16.760
Isn't giving it to Mr. Chen Xuanqing

12:17.120 --> 12:18.200
too forward?

12:19.560 --> 12:21.120
I want to be straightforward.

12:22.000 --> 12:23.920
Let him know how I feel.

12:24.160 --> 12:25.760
Then I'll know how he feels too.

12:26.360 --> 12:27.960
After all, I'm a girl.

12:28.240 --> 12:30.320
I can't keep meeting him in secret.

12:30.840 --> 12:33.040
And I don't want to spend my days

12:33.440 --> 12:34.880
guessing and second guessing.

12:35.840 --> 12:36.640
I'd rather just

12:36.720 --> 12:38.840
ask him once and be done with it.

12:42.280 --> 12:43.000
But

12:43.200 --> 12:44.800
I do think he

12:45.360 --> 12:46.880
has feelings for me.

12:47.600 --> 12:48.680
Why else

12:49.160 --> 12:50.520
would he ask me out?

13:01.560 --> 13:02.560
Are you sure she's going to

13:02.560 --> 13:03.560
see Chen Xuanqing?

13:04.200 --> 13:05.160
Most likely.

13:06.200 --> 13:07.160
Even if she isn't,

13:07.360 --> 13:08.240
why are you panicking?

13:08.600 --> 13:09.720
Just wait and see.

13:12.720 --> 13:13.960
It's flying!

13:14.120 --> 13:14.720
Miss!

13:16.240 --> 13:17.440
So high!

13:40.360 --> 13:41.920
It really is Chen Xuanqing.

13:42.480 --> 13:43.280
Let's follow them.

13:44.120 --> 13:44.760
Go over there.

13:44.920 --> 13:45.680
That place is small.

13:45.720 --> 13:46.520
Don't let them spot us.

13:48.360 --> 13:49.600
Okay, let's go.

13:50.840 --> 13:52.000
Miss Gu came early.

13:52.280 --> 13:53.360
She's flying a kite.

13:55.720 --> 13:56.440
A kite?

13:57.600 --> 13:58.280
Look.

14:22.040 --> 14:22.880
A kite.

14:23.280 --> 14:24.440
Miss Gu is...

14:26.280 --> 14:26.800
Xuanqing.

14:28.800 --> 14:29.320
Xuanqing?

14:34.720 --> 14:35.840
You go alone.

14:36.200 --> 14:37.000
I'm not going.

14:37.920 --> 14:38.760
When you get there,

14:39.120 --> 14:40.120
tell her

14:40.320 --> 14:41.080
something came up

14:41.280 --> 14:42.320
and I really can't make it.

14:45.600 --> 14:46.480
Give this

14:46.720 --> 14:47.520
to her for me.

14:49.120 --> 14:49.640
But...

14:50.720 --> 14:52.160
Why?

14:52.560 --> 14:54.240
Miss Gu has been waiting for you.

14:55.640 --> 14:56.360
Besides,

14:56.560 --> 14:58.120
we're the ones who asked her to come.

14:59.120 --> 14:59.800
I know.

15:00.480 --> 15:01.160
But

15:01.520 --> 15:02.440
I can't see her right now.

15:03.200 --> 15:04.000
It's not the right time.

15:04.880 --> 15:06.200
Are you sure about this?

15:20.840 --> 15:22.040
Thank you for the birthday gift.

15:23.240 --> 15:24.560
I hope one day

15:25.200 --> 15:26.520
I can be as brave

15:27.120 --> 15:27.840
and free

15:28.880 --> 15:29.560
as you.

15:40.640 --> 15:41.400
See?

15:42.360 --> 15:43.200
I wasn't lying.

15:43.720 --> 15:45.280
Told you Jinzhao and Chen Xuanqing

15:45.280 --> 15:46.440
were secretly seeing each other.

15:47.160 --> 15:48.360
Now you have something on her.

15:48.360 --> 15:49.560
She won't be able to bully you anymore.

15:50.600 --> 15:52.120
Jinzhao really is something.

15:52.280 --> 15:53.920
Her reputation is already this bad,

15:54.080 --> 15:55.240
and she still acts so carelessly.

15:55.840 --> 15:57.280
If this ever gets out...

15:57.280 --> 15:58.520
This must never get out!

15:59.920 --> 16:00.560
Swear

16:00.840 --> 16:01.400
you won't tell anyone

16:01.400 --> 16:02.480
what you saw today.

16:02.800 --> 16:03.600
You never saw

16:03.600 --> 16:04.480
Jinzhao

16:04.480 --> 16:05.240
or Chen Xuanqing.

16:05.560 --> 16:06.480
None of it ever happened.

16:06.760 --> 16:07.960
Have you lost your mind?

16:08.400 --> 16:09.760
What's wrong with you?

16:10.960 --> 16:11.760
You said it yourself,

16:11.880 --> 16:12.960
Jinzhao's reputation is already bad.

16:13.120 --> 16:13.960
If we add secret meetings

16:13.960 --> 16:14.840
to that,

16:15.000 --> 16:16.040
how could that end well?

16:16.720 --> 16:17.800
She's our older sister.

16:17.800 --> 16:19.040
If her reputation is ruined,

16:19.360 --> 16:21.120
it hurts both you and me.

16:21.480 --> 16:23.720
Since when are you so protective of her?

16:24.000 --> 16:24.640
She's family,

16:24.640 --> 16:25.880
not a stranger.

16:28.160 --> 16:29.960
Then tell Father and Mother.

16:30.240 --> 16:30.840
Not them either.

16:31.160 --> 16:31.960
If Father finds out,

16:31.960 --> 16:33.200
your mother will know too.

16:34.000 --> 16:35.520
I know what your mother

16:35.520 --> 16:36.400
and Nanny Zhou did

16:36.400 --> 16:37.320
to Jinzhao's marriage prospects.

16:37.800 --> 16:38.920
That was all a misunderstanding.

16:39.440 --> 16:40.760
Misunderstanding or not,

16:40.960 --> 16:42.040
I don't trust Father

16:42.320 --> 16:43.520
and I don't trust your mother.

16:44.240 --> 16:45.000
Don't worry.

16:45.480 --> 16:46.760
I know this has nothing to do with you.

16:47.080 --> 16:47.840
To me,

16:47.960 --> 16:49.400
you're you. They're them.

16:51.520 --> 16:52.280
Just promise me.

16:52.400 --> 16:53.480
Don't tell anyone

16:53.480 --> 16:54.160
what you saw today.

16:55.760 --> 16:56.560
Come on!

16:56.560 --> 16:57.200
Fine!

16:57.520 --> 16:58.120
You're so annoying.

16:58.840 --> 16:59.560
Don't you forget it!

17:02.520 --> 17:03.760
What time is it now?

17:04.359 --> 17:05.520
Why isn't he here yet?

17:06.560 --> 17:07.640
Miss, be patient.

17:07.960 --> 17:09.319
We arrived early.

17:13.480 --> 17:14.480
Miss, he's here.

17:18.160 --> 17:18.839
Miss Gu.

17:19.400 --> 17:20.200
Miss Qingpu.

17:21.000 --> 17:21.960
Where is your master?

17:22.359 --> 17:23.359
He had things to do

17:23.560 --> 17:24.520
at the academy today

17:24.720 --> 17:25.599
and couldn't get away,

17:26.160 --> 17:27.800
so he can't make it.

17:29.240 --> 17:30.080
I'm really sorry.

17:30.680 --> 17:31.680
He asked me

17:31.680 --> 17:32.920
to give you this.

17:44.320 --> 17:45.280
We had an agreement.

17:45.280 --> 17:46.560
Why did he suddenly not come?

17:46.880 --> 17:47.680
Qingpu,

17:47.880 --> 17:48.800
stop.

17:51.320 --> 17:52.760
I understand what your master

17:53.000 --> 17:53.720
means.

18:03.800 --> 18:04.680
Miss.

18:05.000 --> 18:06.320
He's just playing with you.

18:07.000 --> 18:07.600
What is Mr. Chen

18:07.600 --> 18:09.000
thinking anyway?

18:10.440 --> 18:11.760
Whatever he's thinking.

18:13.760 --> 18:15.000
I did my best.

18:15.680 --> 18:16.520
Him not showing up

18:16.760 --> 18:17.920
is on him.

18:19.040 --> 18:20.280
I just need to know I tried

18:20.800 --> 18:21.920
and I have no regrets.

19:01.680 --> 19:02.240
Miss.

19:02.800 --> 19:03.520
The Madam

19:03.520 --> 19:05.040
sent over some new jewelry

19:05.440 --> 19:07.080
for you to use during the New Year.

19:08.840 --> 19:09.920
That's thoughtful of her.

19:11.280 --> 19:11.960
Open it.

19:12.320 --> 19:13.040
Let me see.

19:24.120 --> 19:26.080
This color suits you.

19:26.360 --> 19:27.200
Put them on

19:27.440 --> 19:28.160
and let me see.

19:29.880 --> 19:30.600
Miss,

19:30.840 --> 19:31.680
I don't need them.

19:32.280 --> 19:33.120
Come on.

19:46.480 --> 19:47.760
This color is plain.

19:48.440 --> 19:49.440
Can't pair them

19:49.440 --> 19:50.760
with gold or gems.

19:52.480 --> 19:53.800
Just a

19:54.920 --> 19:56.480
simple bracelet then.

19:57.600 --> 19:58.400
This one works.

19:58.960 --> 19:59.880
Miss.

20:01.120 --> 20:01.840
Put it on.

20:14.800 --> 20:15.720
So pretty.

20:24.800 --> 20:25.720
Qingpu.

20:26.040 --> 20:26.720
I wish we could go back

20:26.720 --> 20:28.040
to Tongzhou for the New Year.

20:30.000 --> 20:30.960
I want to be

20:31.520 --> 20:32.960
with Grandmother,

20:34.840 --> 20:36.960
watching Iron Fireworks with my brother.

21:33.800 --> 21:34.840
When did you get here?

21:41.240 --> 21:42.360
I've been here for a while.

21:42.800 --> 21:44.080
Saw you were lost in thought,

21:44.360 --> 21:45.080
so I didn't want to disturb you.

21:45.400 --> 21:46.320
You

21:48.000 --> 21:49.680
are always so formal.

21:50.880 --> 21:51.880
I asked you here

21:51.880 --> 21:53.840
for your advice.

21:54.680 --> 21:56.840
Tongzhou's autumn tax this year

21:57.000 --> 22:00.160
is 50% higher than last year's.

22:01.160 --> 22:02.080
This is all thanks to

22:02.320 --> 22:03.960
the land equalization.

22:03.960 --> 22:04.960
I've been wondering

22:05.880 --> 22:07.800
how to spread the word

22:08.880 --> 22:10.240
about this success.

22:10.760 --> 22:12.080
Help me come up with something.

22:12.400 --> 22:14.120
Let the court

22:14.200 --> 22:15.760
and common people

22:15.760 --> 22:17.000
see the benefits

22:17.600 --> 22:18.720
of land surveying

22:19.280 --> 22:21.360
and the new tax laws.

22:21.840 --> 22:23.080
But we can't spend too much money.

22:23.520 --> 22:25.080
Can't just blow everything

22:25.240 --> 22:27.240
we've just earned.

22:32.120 --> 22:34.320
I actually do have an idea.

22:34.560 --> 22:35.080
Go on.

22:36.680 --> 22:37.440
In recent years,

22:38.080 --> 22:39.240
because the court has no money,

22:39.840 --> 22:40.640
we haven't seen

22:40.640 --> 22:42.240
the Aoshan Lantern display.

22:43.240 --> 22:43.880
So I think

22:44.480 --> 22:45.600
you should propose

22:45.760 --> 22:46.560
that the Ministry of Revenue

22:46.800 --> 22:47.400
fund them

22:47.920 --> 22:49.160
and set them up again this year.

22:49.360 --> 22:50.040
Then

22:50.240 --> 22:51.200
bring in

22:51.720 --> 22:53.640
the best folk performances

22:54.120 --> 22:54.520
from

22:54.800 --> 22:55.240
across the country,

22:55.560 --> 22:56.360
like street shows,

22:56.680 --> 22:57.280
dragon

22:57.840 --> 22:58.520
and lion dances,

22:58.600 --> 22:59.480
and Qinqiang opera.

22:59.880 --> 23:01.240
Especially the Iron Fireworks.

23:01.720 --> 23:03.000
They're lively and lucky.

23:03.400 --> 23:04.080
I

23:04.080 --> 23:05.240
haven't seen them in years.

23:05.680 --> 23:06.840
Let the people of the capital

23:06.840 --> 23:07.880
have a real celebration.

23:08.240 --> 23:09.720
And on top of that,

23:09.960 --> 23:10.880
set up more porridge kitchens

23:11.080 --> 23:12.040
to help the refugees.

23:12.400 --> 23:13.160
Let everyone

23:13.320 --> 23:14.320
have a proper New Year.

23:14.520 --> 23:15.000
Good.

23:15.200 --> 23:16.720
Great idea.

23:17.280 --> 23:19.000
Build up the momentum

23:19.200 --> 23:21.360
and make the people happy.

23:21.520 --> 23:21.960
Good.

23:22.160 --> 23:22.960
Excellent!

23:25.760 --> 23:26.440
But one thing.

23:26.920 --> 23:28.920
The grace should come from above.

23:29.160 --> 23:31.360
Instead of in Revenue's name,

23:31.360 --> 23:32.200
do it

23:35.480 --> 23:36.920
in His Majesty's name.

23:38.560 --> 23:39.240
Understood.

23:40.720 --> 23:41.720
That's wise of you.

23:49.840 --> 23:50.520
Take it easy.

23:52.720 --> 23:54.240
Why are you coughing again?

23:54.960 --> 23:55.880
I thought

23:56.360 --> 23:57.560
you were getting better.

23:58.240 --> 23:59.800
I wasn't coughing at all a few days ago.

24:00.360 --> 24:01.360
Don't know why

24:01.360 --> 24:03.000
it's back.

24:11.680 --> 24:12.320
Have some tea.

24:12.760 --> 24:13.360
Okay.

24:15.760 --> 24:17.120
This is the end of the year.

24:17.440 --> 24:18.520
Don't just stand there.

24:19.240 --> 24:20.000
Sit down.

24:24.400 --> 24:25.240
Sit.

24:48.000 --> 24:48.680
Rong.

24:50.040 --> 24:51.000
There's

24:51.360 --> 24:53.120
too much rich food in your bowl.

24:53.280 --> 24:54.480
It causes internal heartiness.

24:54.600 --> 24:55.840
Eat some vegetables.

24:56.520 --> 24:57.160
Thank you, Mother.

24:59.440 --> 25:00.040
Father.

25:07.720 --> 25:08.520
Thank you, Father.

25:11.640 --> 25:12.800
Have some vegetables.

25:14.440 --> 25:15.320
Thank you, Mother.

25:16.720 --> 25:17.840
Have some more.

25:23.240 --> 25:24.320
Grandmother.

25:24.520 --> 25:26.320
I want some meatballs.

25:27.760 --> 25:28.200
Here.

25:28.360 --> 25:30.280
Move the meatballs closer.

25:32.080 --> 25:33.400
Jinzhao

25:33.400 --> 25:35.320
loves meatballs.

25:35.600 --> 25:35.960
Here.

25:36.840 --> 25:38.560
Let me get you some.

25:41.080 --> 25:41.440
Here.

25:41.720 --> 25:42.360
Yao.

25:42.680 --> 25:44.320
Let me give you one too.

25:46.280 --> 25:47.200
Is it good?

25:47.680 --> 25:48.400
Yes.

26:07.960 --> 26:08.400
Here.

26:10.240 --> 26:11.360
Your grandmother says

26:11.360 --> 26:13.200
you love meatballs.

26:13.600 --> 26:14.360
Try it

26:14.560 --> 26:15.600
and see if it tastes the same

26:15.600 --> 26:16.080
as the one

26:16.080 --> 26:17.400
in Tongzhou.

26:29.960 --> 26:30.600
Delicious.

26:30.880 --> 26:31.640
Have some more.

26:31.920 --> 26:33.240
You've wasted away.

26:33.480 --> 26:35.280
Your clothes look so loose on you.

26:39.960 --> 26:41.200
I feel like

26:41.600 --> 26:42.600
you've been

26:43.160 --> 26:44.640
a bit down lately.

26:44.960 --> 26:46.640
Firecrackers!

26:48.520 --> 26:49.440
I want to go to the temple fair.

26:51.640 --> 26:53.160
I want to go too!

26:54.280 --> 26:54.920
Go on.

26:57.120 --> 26:57.520
Let's go.

26:57.560 --> 26:58.000
Let's go.

26:58.720 --> 26:59.640
Be careful.

26:59.800 --> 27:00.720
Got it!

27:01.880 --> 27:02.880
You should go too.

27:03.440 --> 27:04.640
Out with the old, in with the new.

27:05.000 --> 27:06.080
Don't carry

27:06.480 --> 27:07.520
the bad luck and unhappiness

27:07.640 --> 27:09.120
into the new year.

27:27.560 --> 27:28.200
Miss,

27:28.520 --> 27:29.560
time to drink your medicine.

27:33.160 --> 27:35.080
When will I be done with this medicine?

27:36.480 --> 27:37.880
I was perfectly fine.

27:38.600 --> 27:40.200
Why am I coughing again?

27:41.400 --> 27:43.120
Coughs come and go.

27:43.680 --> 27:44.480
It's been

27:44.760 --> 27:45.480
dry

27:45.640 --> 27:46.480
and dusty lately.

27:46.960 --> 27:48.560
That can easily trigger a cough.

27:49.680 --> 27:51.000
Just keep warm.

27:51.360 --> 27:52.000
Maybe

27:52.000 --> 27:53.520
you'll be better in a few days.

27:56.120 --> 27:57.760
I hope so.

28:07.760 --> 28:08.400
What's wrong?

28:17.680 --> 28:18.600
I'll go get a physician!

28:18.600 --> 28:19.240
Wait.

28:19.880 --> 28:21.200
It's the New Year.

28:22.080 --> 28:23.400
Where are you going to find a physician?

28:23.800 --> 28:24.760
But Miss...

28:24.880 --> 28:26.040
Don't say anything yet.

28:26.560 --> 28:27.320
Listen to me.

28:27.840 --> 28:28.600
But...

28:29.040 --> 28:29.760
This is

28:29.960 --> 28:31.040
Jinzhao's first New Year

28:31.040 --> 28:32.160
at home.

28:32.680 --> 28:34.000
If I tell them this,

28:34.960 --> 28:35.520
the kids

28:35.920 --> 28:37.160
won't have fun.

28:39.240 --> 28:40.120
Don't ruin the mood.

28:40.640 --> 28:42.680
Let's wait till after the New Year.

28:44.560 --> 28:45.320
The Madam's coughing so loud

28:45.320 --> 28:46.880
we can hear it across the courtyard.

28:47.400 --> 28:48.520
Did you call a physician?

28:48.880 --> 28:49.480
No.

28:50.080 --> 28:50.720
It seems the Madam

28:50.800 --> 28:52.520
had the Master keep the New Year's vigil.

28:52.520 --> 28:53.640
He's staying in the front courtyard.

28:53.760 --> 28:55.000
No need to go to the Madam's courtyard.

28:55.760 --> 28:57.480
Why did it suddenly get so bad?

28:58.000 --> 28:59.760
She was fine just a few days ago.

29:05.200 --> 29:06.440
Liuxiang, you can go now.

29:06.640 --> 29:07.960
I want to talk to Nanny Zhou alone.

29:16.120 --> 29:17.200
I added rhubarb

29:17.200 --> 29:18.040
to the Madam's medicine.

29:18.400 --> 29:19.200
What?

29:19.440 --> 29:20.880
Keep your voice down.

29:22.800 --> 29:24.280
How could you put that in her...

29:24.880 --> 29:25.440
Nanny Zhou.

29:25.440 --> 29:27.160
I really had no choice.

29:27.400 --> 29:28.680
Don't you see?

29:29.000 --> 29:30.240
Only if she's really sick

29:30.240 --> 29:31.560
will the Master let you run the household.

29:32.120 --> 29:33.920
Still, we can't do that.

29:34.600 --> 29:36.160
Think about Lan's coming-of-age ceremony

29:36.160 --> 29:37.280
and her future dowry.

29:38.400 --> 29:39.600
I did all of this.

29:40.000 --> 29:41.680
Just pretend I never told you.

29:41.920 --> 29:42.760
But we can't...

29:42.760 --> 29:43.680
The Master is here!

30:19.280 --> 30:20.440
Well, if it isn't Mr. Chen.

30:21.000 --> 30:22.440
Happy New Year.

30:22.680 --> 30:23.760
I wish you well.

30:24.960 --> 30:26.760
Mr. Su, happy New Year to you too.

30:28.400 --> 30:29.600
I rented

30:29.600 --> 30:30.880
a two-room suite up ahead.

30:31.160 --> 30:31.800
Would you care

30:31.920 --> 30:33.400
to come upstairs and take a look?

30:33.760 --> 30:34.840
Better than getting jostled around

30:34.840 --> 30:35.760
down here with the crowd.

30:37.880 --> 30:40.280
I'll go see the Aoshan Lantern display.

30:40.800 --> 30:41.400
I'll come to you

30:41.640 --> 30:42.680
in a bit.

30:43.400 --> 30:43.840
Alright.

30:43.960 --> 30:45.040
It's a deal.

31:18.640 --> 31:19.960
Rong, wait for me!

31:21.600 --> 31:22.720
I've seen plenty of dragon dances.

31:22.800 --> 31:24.240
But a fire-breathing dragon is rare.

31:24.400 --> 31:25.360
Watch out.

31:25.760 --> 31:26.320
I'm fine.

31:26.440 --> 31:27.240
Let's go somewhere else for a look.

31:28.240 --> 31:29.680
I was telling people

31:29.760 --> 31:30.640
that the New Year in the capital

31:30.640 --> 31:31.800
isn't as lively as in Tongzhou.

31:32.160 --> 31:32.880
Seems

31:33.000 --> 31:34.160
I was talking big.

31:34.600 --> 31:36.240
I think you were right.

31:36.360 --> 31:38.400
Sure, the capital is busier,

31:38.720 --> 31:40.160
but they don't have Iron Fireworks.

31:40.880 --> 31:41.800
So Tongzhou is still better.

31:45.880 --> 31:48.040
Walking over bridges cures all illnesses.

31:48.480 --> 31:49.440
Let's go do that.

31:51.800 --> 31:52.560
Rong.

31:56.480 --> 31:57.480
Where did he go?

31:58.080 --> 31:58.560
Let's go.

32:03.600 --> 32:05.240
Sir, it's just us now.

32:07.400 --> 32:07.960
Gentlemen,

32:08.160 --> 32:08.920
take care.

32:08.920 --> 32:09.360
Let's go.

32:09.960 --> 32:10.400
Okay.

32:10.400 --> 32:11.200
Come again tomorrow.

32:11.880 --> 32:12.360
Alright.

32:13.880 --> 32:14.280
Sir.

32:14.280 --> 32:15.040
Mr. Gu!

32:15.400 --> 32:16.920
You're not resting during the New Year?

32:17.560 --> 32:18.360
If no one else is resting,

32:18.360 --> 32:19.040
why should I?

32:19.520 --> 32:20.040
Alright, alright.

32:20.040 --> 32:20.880
Right this way.

32:21.680 --> 32:22.200
After you.

32:26.640 --> 32:27.640
Why are there so many people?

32:28.520 --> 32:29.560
This was your stupid idea.

32:30.240 --> 32:30.840
Sir,

32:31.200 --> 32:33.240
you asked me

32:33.240 --> 32:34.520
where the ladies of the capital

32:34.520 --> 32:35.920
go for New Year outings.

32:36.440 --> 32:37.640
I was just asking casually.

32:37.880 --> 32:38.680
You took it too seriously.

32:41.080 --> 32:41.720
Miss Gu?

32:42.240 --> 32:43.320
Mr. Ye.

32:53.600 --> 32:54.160
Sir,

32:54.560 --> 32:55.240
is Miss Gu

32:55.360 --> 32:56.520
still mad at you?

32:57.040 --> 32:57.720
No one

32:58.000 --> 32:58.880
is asking you to speak.

33:01.360 --> 33:01.920
Miss.

33:02.040 --> 33:03.240
He's the heir of Lord Changxing.

33:03.400 --> 33:04.440
Wouldn't it be rude

33:04.600 --> 33:05.880
if we just run off like this?

33:07.280 --> 33:08.480
If I stay,

33:08.840 --> 33:10.360
I'll only be even ruder!

33:10.880 --> 33:12.160
I'm doing this for his own good.

33:19.720 --> 33:20.280
Miss,

33:20.400 --> 33:21.040
didn't you say the capital

33:21.040 --> 33:22.200
doesn't have Iron Fireworks?

33:22.280 --> 33:23.880
Let's go up ahead and see!

33:24.000 --> 33:24.560
Okay.

33:26.200 --> 33:27.200
Sir, look over there.

33:56.840 --> 33:57.720
Let's go that way!

34:22.000 --> 34:23.120
So

34:24.239 --> 34:25.400
this is Iron Fireworks.

34:25.920 --> 34:26.960
You've never seen it before?

34:30.840 --> 34:31.600
I'm an idiot.

34:32.239 --> 34:33.000
I forgot you've been

34:33.199 --> 34:34.800
in central Sichuan all these years.

34:56.520 --> 34:57.560
I thought I wouldn't

34:57.720 --> 34:59.240
get to see Iron Fireworks this year.

35:00.160 --> 35:01.360
But here they are.

35:04.480 --> 35:06.440
So for every loss,

35:07.520 --> 35:08.560
there's a gain.

35:09.920 --> 35:10.920
Since that's the case,

35:11.240 --> 35:12.560
I shouldn't go looking for trouble.

35:16.640 --> 35:17.560
I can't believe the capital

35:17.560 --> 35:18.880
has Iron Fireworks.

35:20.440 --> 35:21.440
I wonder if Jinzhao

35:21.440 --> 35:22.200
saw it.

35:22.840 --> 35:24.240
She's always loved watching this.

35:25.040 --> 35:26.000
Grandmother even brought

35:26.320 --> 35:27.560
a Shanxi troupe

35:27.720 --> 35:28.760
to Tongzhou just for her.

35:29.360 --> 35:30.880
You should be thanking me.

35:32.480 --> 35:33.920
If I hadn't dragged you along,

35:34.440 --> 35:36.040
you'd have missed this grand spectacle.

35:48.320 --> 35:54.320
Long live the Great Yan!

35:55.000 --> 36:01.160
Long live the Great Yan!

36:01.680 --> 36:08.200
Long live the Great Yan!

36:08.800 --> 36:15.320
Long live the Great Yan!

36:16.080 --> 36:22.600
Long live the Great Yan!

36:23.080 --> 36:29.600
Long live the Great Yan!

36:29.960 --> 36:36.480
Long live the Great Yan!

36:37.000 --> 36:43.520
Long live the Great Yan!

36:44.000 --> 36:46.560
Long live the Great Yan!

36:46.920 --> 36:47.880
Mr. Chen Yanyun?

36:47.880 --> 36:50.160
Long live the Great Yan!

36:50.720 --> 36:53.600
Long live the Great Yan!

36:56.360 --> 36:57.240
Someone fell in the water!

36:57.240 --> 36:57.920
Help!

36:58.280 --> 36:59.080
Help!

36:59.080 --> 37:00.000
- Chen Yi.
- Sir.

37:01.440 --> 37:02.240
Hurry and save her!

37:02.480 --> 37:03.480
Someone fell in the water!

37:03.640 --> 37:04.200
Sir,

37:04.560 --> 37:05.680
I think someone fell in.

37:07.200 --> 37:08.120
Help!

37:08.160 --> 37:08.680
Let's go check it out.

37:08.760 --> 37:10.240
Someone fell in over there!

38:24.560 --> 38:25.760
He got her out.

38:26.880 --> 38:27.800
She's safe.

38:36.720 --> 38:37.320
Are you alright?

38:39.400 --> 38:40.440
It's you.

38:43.720 --> 38:44.480
Thank you, Mr. Chen.

38:44.480 --> 38:45.480
Miss! Miss!

38:48.400 --> 38:49.480
Are you alright?

38:50.280 --> 38:51.400
I'm fine.

38:57.480 --> 38:58.080
Sir,

38:58.560 --> 38:59.440
isn't that

38:59.440 --> 39:00.480
Mr. Chen Yanyun's guard?

39:01.000 --> 39:01.560
Could it be...

39:03.800 --> 39:04.480
It is him.

39:21.400 --> 39:22.160
Don't catch a cold.

39:24.800 --> 39:25.560
Thanks.

39:41.280 --> 39:41.920
Miss,

39:42.080 --> 39:43.440
Lord Guan saved you.

39:45.960 --> 39:47.080
No.

39:48.280 --> 39:49.520
It was Mr. Chen Yanyun.

39:59.840 --> 40:00.560
You mean the person

40:00.720 --> 40:01.720
who saved you at the back mountain

40:01.720 --> 40:02.280
in Tongzhou

40:02.280 --> 40:03.200
wasn't Mr. Chen Xuanqing,

40:03.320 --> 40:04.120
but Mr. Chen Yanyun?

40:06.040 --> 40:07.040
In the water,

40:07.280 --> 40:08.840
when he was pulling me to shore,

40:09.200 --> 40:10.760
it all came back to me.

40:13.320 --> 40:14.120
Miss,

40:14.200 --> 40:14.760
so

40:15.080 --> 40:15.960
Mr. Chen Yanyun

40:16.200 --> 40:17.640
has saved you three times now.

40:20.440 --> 40:21.520
Yeah.

40:25.160 --> 40:26.760
How am I ever going to

40:27.360 --> 40:28.920
repay such a favor?

41:15.080 --> 41:16.040
Why does my drawing

41:16.680 --> 41:18.240
look so much like...

41:35.600 --> 41:36.480
Jinzhao?

41:39.480 --> 41:39.920
Sir,

41:40.120 --> 41:41.120
the ginger soup is ready.

41:42.960 --> 41:43.800
Leave it over there.

41:44.200 --> 41:44.840
Yes.

41:55.040 --> 41:55.600
Chen Yi.

41:57.520 --> 41:58.160
Sir.

42:00.240 --> 42:01.200
Go

42:01.680 --> 42:02.760
invite Miss Gu over.

42:04.080 --> 42:04.720
Yes.

42:05.400 --> 42:06.000
Sir,

42:06.480 --> 42:07.800
what is this about?

42:08.240 --> 42:09.880
Just go invite her.

42:11.040 --> 42:11.600
Yes.

42:11.880 --> 42:12.640
I spoke out of turn.

42:17.000 --> 42:17.960
Wait. Come back.

42:23.360 --> 42:23.960
Never mind.

42:24.400 --> 42:25.200
You can go now.

42:28.920 --> 42:29.520
Yes.
